      "tex": "\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{a_mx^m+\\cdots}{b_nx^n+\\cdots}=\\begin{cases}0,&m<n\\\\\\frac{a_m}{b_n},&m=n\\\\\\infty,&m>n\\end{cases}",
      "note": "比较分子分母最高次数",
